IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. P-43-EVALUATE-ANY.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 A PIC 9 VALUE 2.
01 B PIC 9 VALUE 9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
EVALUATE A ALSO B
 WHEN 2 ALSO ANY DISPLAY "A2-ANY-B"
 WHEN ANY ALSO 9 DISPLAY "ANY-B9"
 WHEN OTHER DISPLAY "OTHER"
END-EVALUATE
STOP RUN.
